# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Instrucciones de instalación de la última versión de la diagonalización cuántica basada en muestras (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Instrucciones de instalación"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Instrucciones de instalación {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To install, first create a new Python environment:\n"
msgstr "Para instalar, primero crea un nuevo entorno de Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Requisitos previos {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Crea un entorno mínimo con solo Python instalado. Recomendamos usar [entornos virtuales de Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Activa tu nuevo entorno.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Windows, run `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate` instead.\n"
msgstr "En Windows, ejecuta `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate` en su lugar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Hay dos formas principales de instalar este paquete: desde PyPI o desde el código fuente. El método preferido es instalar desde PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Instalar desde PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optional `sbd` and `fulqrum` extras, and the `notebook-dependencies` extra that includes them, are supported only on Linux and macOS.\n"
msgstr "Los extras opcionales `sbd` y `fulqrum`, y el extra `notebook-dependencies` que los incluye, solo son compatibles con Linux y macOS.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Instalar desde el código fuente {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source if you wish to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "Instala desde el código fuente si deseas desarrollar en el repositorio o ejecutar los notebooks localmente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-sqd` repository.\n"
msgstr "El primer paso es clonar el repositorio `qiskit-addon-sqd`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "A continuación, actualiza pip y entra en el repositorio.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-sqd` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies in order to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. Install the `dev` dependencies if you plan on developing in the repository.\n"
msgstr "El siguiente paso es instalar `qiskit-addon-sqd` en el entorno virtual. Si planeas ejecutar los notebooks, instala las dependencias de los notebooks para poder ejecutar todas las visualizaciones que contienen. Instala las dependencias `dev` si planeas desarrollar en el repositorio.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Ajusta las opciones siguientes según tus necesidades.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Si instalaste las dependencias de los notebooks, puedes empezar ejecutando los notebooks de la documentación.\n"
